  "identity": {
    "text": "Hello, Cal. On class days, I wake at five. I get up and wash my face. My room is cool. What time do you wake?\n\nI have a blue shirt today. I also have a dress, but I choose the shirt. The sun is out, so I put a hat on my head before I leave.\n\nYes. I start at ten. I eat lunch at one and finish class at three. After class, I stay in the room for five minutes. I check a note for the teacher.\n\nI lift my hand to wave to a friend. I eat dinner at six. Before dinner, I write my class time for tomorrow. I plan to wear my dress tomorrow.",
